rch preview for cloud-based bug-hunting agents, session recaps showing activity while terminal was unfocused, custom themes system, and a redesigned web experience with sessions sidebar and drag-and-drop layout.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://releasebot.io/updates/anthropic/claude-code\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-27\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"GPT-5.5 Available\",\n    \"description\": \"April 24, 2026 announcement: GPT-5.5 model is now available in Windsurf.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-24\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Week 16: Opus 4.7 Default, xhigh Effort, Cloud Routines, Native CLI Binaries\",\n    \"description\": \"Claude Opus 4.7 becomes default on Max and Team Premium tiers with new 'xhigh' effort level. Also introduces cloud routines for automated agents, /ultrareview parallel code review, /usage tracking, and migration to native CLI binaries for improved performance.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://releasebot.io/updates/anthropic/claude-code\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-20\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n",
