s in AI-Powered Development</div>\n   252→        </header>\n   253→\n   254→        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n   255→            <!-- New Products Section -->\n   256→            <section class=\"column new-products\">\n   257→                <div class=\"column-header\">New Products (13)</div>\n   258→\n   259→                <div class=\"item\">\n   260→                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://wuphf.team\" target=\"_blank\">WUPHF by Nex.ai</a></div>\n   261→                    <div class=\"item-description\">Collaborative office of AI employees with shared wiki. Slack-style interface for AI agents. Compatible with Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw agents.</div>\n   262→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   263→                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n   264→                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt, Show HN</span>\n   265→                    </div>\n   266→                    <div class=\"stats\">#1 on HN Show HN, 139 upvotes</div>\n   267→                </div>\n   268→\n   269→                <div class=\"item\">\n   270→                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://mistral.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Mistral Medium 3.5</a></div>\n   271→                    <div class=\"item-description\">128B dense model for coding, reasoning, and long tasks. First merged flagship with configurable reasoning, 256k context, 77.6% on SWE-Bench Verified.</div>\n   272→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   273→                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n   274→                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n   275→                    </div>\n   276→                </div>\n   277→\n   278→                <div class=\"item\">\n   279→                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://tabstack.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Tabstack</a></div>\n   280→                    <div class=\"item-description\">Extract web data and automate bro