    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-05-03</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 5px 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .date {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            align-items: start;\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .column-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 12pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #999999;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #666666;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .source {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .version-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-family: Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #e6f7ff;\n            color: #0050b3;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.bugfix {\n            background-color: #fff2e8;\n            color: #ad4e00;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #f6ffed;\n            color: #389e0d;\n        }\n\n        .insight-author {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #666666;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .topic {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n            color: #666666;\n            padding: 2px 5px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            margin-right: 3px;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            padding: 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #666666;\n            padding-left: 15px;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            margin: 5px 0;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n        }\n\n        .stats {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">2026-05-03 - Daily Updates in AI-Powered Development</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"column new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">New Products (13)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://wuphf.team\" target=\"_blank\">WUPHF by Nex.ai</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Collaborative office of AI employees with shared wiki. Slack-style interface for AI agents. Compatible with Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt, Show HN</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stats\">#1 on HN Show HN, 139 upvotes</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://mistral.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Mistral Medium 3.5</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">128B dense model for coding, reasoning, and long tasks. First merged flagship with configurable reasoning, 256k context, 77.6% on SWE-Bench Verified.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://tabstack.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Tabstack</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Extract web data and automate browsers without scrapers. API with built-in intelligence. Pass URL and schema, get structured JSON.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stats\">146 upvotes, #6 Product of the Day</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://mintlify.com\" target=\"_blank\">Mintlify Editor</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">AI-native collaborative editor for documentation. Git-synced, WYSIWYG, live collaboration for engineers, marketers, and AI agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE-integrated</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stats\">340 upvotes, #3 Product of the Day</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://rova.qa\" target=\"_blank\">Rova AI</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Autonomous, goal-driven testing for web and mobile apps. AI agent explores apps, validates workflows, adapts to UI changes, generates reports.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stats\">111 upvotes, #12 Product of the Day</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/symphony\" target=\"_blank\">Symphony</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source specification for Codex orchestration. Standards and protocols for coordinating multiple AI coding agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/kimi-k2-6\" target=\"_blank\">Kimi K2.6</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source SOTA model for long-horizon coding and agent swarms. Complex tasks requiring multiple steps and parallel agent coordination.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cosine.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Cosine Swarm</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Parallel AI agents for long-horizon, complex software tasks. Coordinated team of specialized agents for research, implementation, and QA.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"An AI coworker that actually does the work\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/chronicle\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicle</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Build Codex memories from recent screen context. Persistent memory for AI coding agents derived from screen activity.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/spectrum\" target=\"_blank\">Spectrum</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source tool for bringing AI agents to all interfaces people already use. Integrates into existing messaging platforms.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/x-island\" target=\"_blank\">X Island</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Dynamic Island for AI Coding Agents. Compact UI for monitoring agent activity. Shows status and progress in minimal interface.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE-integrated</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/blueprint\" target=\"_blank\">Blueprint</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">One-shot bigger coding tasks. Handles larger coding tasks in single operation. Designed for complex coding challenges.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/basedash-dashboard-agent\" target=\"_blank\">Basedash Dashboard Agent</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Builds entire dashboards from single prompt. Transforms natural language into complete data visualizations.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Product Updates (6)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v3.2.16</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Security Review beta, Cursor SDK for programmatic agents, Canvas visualizations, multitasking with async sub-agents, improved worktrees.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.32</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Fixes crashes when switching Cascade conversations, authentication issues for Devin Cloud, agent question response problems.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bug Fix</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.29</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Devin for Terminal CLI agent with full codebase access. Devin Local agent in Windsurf, up to 30% more token-efficient than Cascade.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Week 17</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://releasebot.io/updates/anthropic/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">/ultrareview public preview for cloud bug-hunting agents, session recaps, custom themes, redesigned web experience with sessions sidebar.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Update</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">GPT-5.5 model now available in Windsurf.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Week 16</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://releasebot.io/updates/anthropic/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Opus 4.7 default on Max and Team Premium, 'xhigh' effort level, cloud routines, /ultrareview parallel review, native CLI binaries.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">2026-04-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Insights (18)</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-typescript/issues/999\" target=\"_blank\">HERMES.md Billing Routing</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Including 'HERMES.md' in commits triggers Anthropic's extra billing tier. Community concerned about transparency.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Anthropic, HN Discussion</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">billing</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://flueframework.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Flue - Agent Harness Framework</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">TypeScript framework for autonomous agents with programmable harness. Agent = Model + Harness architecture.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Flue Team</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">TypeScript</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.mendral.com/blog/agent-harness-belongs-outside-sandbox\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Harness Outside Sandbox</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Mendral argues agent harnesses should run outside sandbox. Credentials stay out, can suspend when idle, sandboxes become cattle.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Mendral</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">architecture</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">sandboxes</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/pull/310226\" target=\"_blank\">VS Code Auto Co-Author Controversy</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">VS Code changed default to auto-add 'Co-authored-by: Copilot' to commits. Community backlash: 129 thumbs down.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Microsoft VS Code Team</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">VS Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Git</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/02/the-best-ai-powered-dictation-apps-of-2025/\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Dictation Apps Ranked</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">TechCrunch review of AI dictation apps. Wispr Flow, Willow, Monologue, Superwhisper, VoiceTypr, Aqua, Typeless, Dictato.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Ivan Mehta, TechCrunch</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">voice AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">dictation</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://hnup.date/hn-sota\" target=\"_blank\">SOTA Coding Models - HN Opinions</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News community discussion on state-of-the-art coding models based on real-world usage and benchmarks.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News Community</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLMs</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">benchmarks</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47932937\" target=\"_blank\">Who Owns AI-Generated Code?</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News discussion (539 points). Claude Code creator says 100% of his recent contributions were AI-written.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Legal Layer, HN Discussion</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">copyright</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">legal</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/05/01/1136800/musk-v-altman-week-1-musk-says-he-was-duped-warns-ai-could-kill-us-all-and-admits-that-xai-distills-openais-models/\" target=\"_blank\">Musk v. Altman Week 1</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Musk admits xAI 'partly' distills OpenAI's models. Trial outcome could upend OpenAI's $1T IPO path. xAI IPO expected June at $1.75T.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">MIT Technology Review</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">OpenAI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">legal</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-enables-cookies-by-default-for-free-chatgpt-users/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI Marketing Cookies Default</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">OpenAI enables marketing cookies by default for free ChatGPT users. Shares limited identifiers with ad partners.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">WIRED</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">OpenAI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">privacy</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/01/meta-buys-robotics-startup-to-bolster-its-humanoid-ai-ambitions/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta Buys Robotics Startup</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Meta acquired Assured Robot Intelligence (ARI) for humanoid AI ambitions. Team joins Superintelligence Labs.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">TechCrunch</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Meta</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">robotics</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/04/30/1136721/this-startups-new-mechanistic-interpretability-tool-lets-you-debug-llms/\" target=\"_blank\">Goodfire Silico - Debug LLMs</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Mechanistic interpretability tool to debug and tweak LLMs by examining neurons and pathways. 'Less alchemy, more science.'</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">MIT Technology Review</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">debugging</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI safety</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.128.0\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI 0.128.0 /goal Feature</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">OpenAI Codex CLI adds /goal feature. Set goal and Codex loops until completion or token budget exhausted.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Codex</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://x.com/karpathy\" target=\"_blank\">Karpathy on Software 3.0</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">At Sequoia AI Ascent 2026: Software 1.0 (rules), 2.0 (data + neural nets), 3.0 (context + prompts). Popularized 'vibe coding.'</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Andrej Karpathy</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">paradigm</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">vibe coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/29/llm/\" target=\"_blank\">LLM 0.32a0 Major Refactor</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Simon Willison's LLM library: model inputs as message sequences, responses as streams of typed parts (text, tools, reasoning).</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Python</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">API</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://zed.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Zed 1.0 Released</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">High-performance AI-native code editor in Rust. Agentic editing, Parallel Agents, Edit Prediction, built-in collaboration.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Nathan Sobo, Zed Industries</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">editor</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Rust</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/27/now-deceased-agi-clause/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI-Microsoft AGI Clause Death</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">AGI clause evolved from 'highly autonomous systems' to '$100B profit' to 'independent panel.' Now dead: license continues through 2032.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">OpenAI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AGI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/VibeVoice\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft VibeVoice Open Sourced</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Frontier voice AI: TTS and ASR at 7.5 Hz. 60-min audio in single pass with diarization. 90-min TTS with 4 speakers. MIT licensed.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Microsoft</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">audio</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">2026-04-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                Generated by <a href=\"https://agentdaily.com\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Code Daily</a> -\n                Powered by <a href=\"https://claude.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Agent SDK</a>\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 8pt;\">\n                Report Date: 2026-05-03 | 13 New Products | 6 Product Updates | 18 Insights\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
